Drupal PHP overrides. Scanned after /etc/php.d (see PHP_INI_SCAN_DIR), so
values here win over Remi defaults. Drop zz-*.ini downstream to override.

Do not add extension= lines — Remi already loads the .so files.

  10-drupal.ini      memory, uploads, time, sessions
  20-opcache.ini     Drupal-sized opcache (immutable image)
  40-apcu.ini        APCu 128M, serializer=php (Drupal 11 core default serializer)
  40-igbinary.ini    compact strings (no session handler)
  50-memcached.ini   igbinary serializer, no default server
  50-redis.ini       comment-only; no host / no session handler

CLI-only overrides live in /etc/drupal/php-cli.d (non-start path only).
